    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10884" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνυπο-νόητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unsuspected,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>
			<i>in</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				61.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρωποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					13.6.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unexpected,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.57.6
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.84.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>unsuspecting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ μέλλοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.10.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				39
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>unsuspiciously,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.39.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
